.TH AVR\-ORG\-SAML\-SHOW 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-saml-show \- Show the current SAML configuration (admin only).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org saml show
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the current SAML configuration (admin only).
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    allow_idp_initiated, attr_email, attr_family_name, attr_given_name,
    attr_groups, created_at, default_role, idp_entity_id, idp_slo_url,
    idp_sso_url, is_enforced, jit_provisioning, name_id_format,
    organization_id, organization_saml_config_id, updated_at
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-saml (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-configure (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-enforcement (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-remove (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-sp-metadata (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-test (1)
